  "cards": [
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful store clerks alongside grooming tensions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many shoppers commend store associates and managers like Jay and Connor for carrying heavy bags to cars and answering questions about diets and dog training. At the same time, several reviewers describe frustrating encounters with salon staff, citing unhelpful attitudes, unaddressed complaints, and an incident where an overheated dog was refused water. Experiences vary between the retail floor and salon."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Responsive product guidance with salon delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Floor associates frequently receive compliments for explaining dietary options, assisting over the phone, and offering guidance for puppy obedience. Conversely, clients using grooming services report poor communication about wait times, lack of proactive updates during lengthy bath appointments, and one delivery dispatched to the wrong address. Communication on the retail side remains far stronger."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring trainers and gentle pet support"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate the supportive atmosphere for dogs, puppies, and rabbits, giving high praise to trainer Jennifer and gentle groomer Taylor for working with sensitive animals. While one visitor strongly criticized staff for refusing drinking water to an overheated dog, most reviewers report caring attention toward their pets and a friendly neighborhood environment."
      }
    }
  ],
