        "en": "Does the store carry food and supplies for small animals and fish?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note finding supplies, food, and feeder insects for rabbits, fish, and other small pets."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Will associates assist customers with loading heavy items?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently report that helpful staff carry heavy bags of dog food directly to their cars."
